---
source: crates/dejafix/src/cli/tests.rs
expression: "block(Platform::Linux, true, &[], false)"
---

══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  MCP client configuration — this project only:

    {
      "mcpServers": {
        "dejafix": {
          "command": "/opt/djf/bin/djf-mcp",
          "args": ["--root", "/work/myproj"]
        }
      }
    }

  Codex uses TOML, not JSON — for ~/.codex/config.toml:

    [mcp_servers.dejafix]
    command = "/opt/djf/bin/djf-mcp"
    args = ["--root", "/work/myproj"]

  Client config file locations:
    Claude Desktop  ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json  ($XDG_CONFIG_HOME)
    Cursor          ~/.cursor/mcp.json  (global; per-project is <repo>/.cursor/mcp.json)
    Antigravity     ~/.gemini/antigravity/mcp_config.json  (legacy IDE; v2 path may differ)
    Codex (TOML!)   ~/.codex/config.toml
    Claude Code     claude mcp add  (or ~/.claude.json)

  After pasting: fully quit and restart your client (cold start).
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
